,"surah":4,"ayah":137,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ثُمَّ كَفَرُوا۟ ثُمَّ ءَامَنُوا۟ ثُمَّ كَفَرُوا۟ ثُمَّ ٱزْدَادُوا۟ كُفْرًا لَّمْ يَكُنِ ٱللَّهُ لِيَغْفِرَ لَهُمْ وَلَا لِيَهْدِيَهُمْ سَبِيلًۢا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"As for those who believe, then reject the faith, then believe again, then reject the faith again and become increasingly defiant, God will not forgive them, nor will He guide them on any path.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believed","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"(again) believed","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱزْدَادُوا۟","en_gloss":"increased","transliteration":"iz'dādū","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كُفْرًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) disbelief ","transliteration":"kuf'ran","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَكُنِ","en_gloss":"will","transliteration":"yakuni","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لِيَغْفِرَ","en_gloss":"forgive","transliteration":"liyaghfira","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"[for] them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":19,"ar":"لِيَهْدِيَهُمْ","en_gloss":"will guide them","transliteration":"liyahdiyahum","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":20,"ar":"سَبِيلًۢا","en_gloss":"(to) a (right) way","transliteration":"sabīlan","verse_key":"4:137"},{"pos":21,"ar":"١٣٧","en_gloss":"(137)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:137"}]},{"verse_key":"4:138","surah":4,"ayah":138,"ar_uthmani":"بَشِّرِ ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ بِأَنَّ لَهُمْ عَذَابًا أَلِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], tell such hypocrites that an agonizing torment awaits them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"بَشِّرِ","en_gloss":"Give tidings","transliteration":"bashiri","verse_key":"4:138"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ","en_gloss":"(to) the hypocrites","transliteration":"l-munāfiqīna","verse_key":"4:138"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِأَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"bi-anna","verse_key":"4:138"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"4:138"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَذَابًا","en_gloss":"(is) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","verse_key":"4:138"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَلِيمًا","en_gloss":"painful ","transliteration":"alīman","verse_key":"4:138"},{"pos":7,"ar":"١٣٨","en_gloss":"(138)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:138"}]},{"verse_key":"4:139","surah":4,"ayah":139,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ يَتَّخِذُونَ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ أَوْلِيَآءَ مِن دُونِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ۚ أَيَبْتَغُونَ عِندَهُمُ ٱلْعِزَّةَ فَإِنَّ ٱلْعِزَّةَ لِلَّهِ جَمِيعًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do those who ally themselves with the disbelievers rather than the believers seek power through them? In reality all power is God’s to give.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:139"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَتَّخِذُونَ","en_gloss":"take","transliteration":"yattakhidhūna","verse_key":"4:139"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"the disbeliev